OL,3,GNEWSAPolice granted more time to
OL,4,Aquestion man arrested on suspicion of
OL,5,Amurder
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolice investigating the disappearance
OL,8,Fof a 39-year-old woman have been
OL,9,Fgranted an additional 36 hours to
OL,10,Fquestion a 35-year-old man arrested on
OL,11,Fsuspicion of her murder.
OL,13,FThe PSNI added that "the investigation
OL,14,Fis continuing at pace".
OL,16,FCarrie Mullane (Noonan), who is from
OL,17,FLimerick, is known to have travelled to
OL,18,FEnniskillen, County Fermanagh, on 10
OL,19,FOctober.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
